WEBVTT

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:05.288
Every dream you have ever had… was kept somewhere.

00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:13.654
On a quiet street, in a small blue house, lived a girl named Mira.

00:00:18.770 --> 00:00:23.041
Three nights. Three nights and not a single dream.

00:00:24.330 --> 00:00:28.026
Night shift, sweetheart. Try to sleep, okay?

00:00:31.610 --> 00:00:33.200
I'll try, Mom.

00:00:35.400 --> 00:00:37.973
That's… not normal.

00:00:47.500 --> 00:00:53.364
Every window on the street held a dream. Every window… but hers.

00:00:55.750 --> 00:00:59.054
Okay, lantern. Where are you taking me?

00:01:05.880 --> 00:01:09.654
A secret staircase. Of course there is.

00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:18.528
Whoa…

00:01:31.540 --> 00:01:38.031
'Tom, age seven. Flying over the sea.' These are… dreams.

00:01:39.000 --> 00:01:45.569
A birthday party… a snowy forest… someone's whole night, in a jar.

00:01:56.600 --> 00:01:59.408
Hey… hey, no, no, no!

00:02:11.190 --> 00:02:13.136
Wait! Come back!

00:02:19.820 --> 00:02:23.046
It will not come back. Not for me.

00:02:23.770 --> 00:02:28.041
Who are you? I'm sorry, I didn't touch anything, I swear!

00:02:28.400 --> 00:02:36.667
I know, child. I am Elias, the Keeper of this Archive. And that dream… opened for you.

00:02:41.190 --> 00:02:45.043
You keep everyone's dreams? Every single one?

00:02:46.420 --> 00:02:52.049
Every dream ever dreamed. Until it is time to give them back.

00:02:57.860 --> 00:03:00.041
There's no name on it.

00:03:01.980 --> 00:03:05.049
Some dreams forget whose they are.

00:03:05.400 --> 00:03:13.171
A runaway dream has seven nights. If it does not return, its dreamer forgets it… forever.

00:03:15.470 --> 00:03:20.054
Take this bell. When your dream is near, it will ring.

00:03:21.420 --> 00:03:25.038
Then I'll find it. Seven nights. I can do that.

00:03:39.490 --> 00:03:43.029
Good morning, sleepyhead. Did you dream tonight?

00:03:43.860 --> 00:03:48.026
Not exactly, Mom. But I think I'm about to.

00:03:49.280 --> 00:03:52.584
You look like you fought a ghost. Cocoa?

00:03:56.250 --> 00:03:57.856
Something like that.

00:04:11.077 --> 00:04:14.302
Is it… snowing? In the sun?

00:04:16.017 --> 00:04:19.321
It's here. The dream is here.

00:04:19.667 --> 00:04:23.206
Mira… why is the snow singing?

00:04:36.667 --> 00:04:40.937
Six nights left. And someone else is looking for the dream.

